    "content": "Across models and conditions, two dominant deficits emerge: fallible representations of the boardstate, leading to invalid moves, and weak heuristic planning, leading to loops or moves that do notadvance the puzzle toward the goal state. This work moves beyond aggregate performance metricsto offer a granular, qualitative analysis of why LLMs struggle with such tasks and how differentinterventions modulate these failures. Our contributions can be summarized as:",
